Step 9: Introduce RAG

A major challenge:

An LLM doesn't know your company's documents.

Solution:

User Question
      │
      ▼
Vector Search
      │
Relevant Chunks
      │
      ▼
LLM
      │
      ▼
Answer

This became known as Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).

LangChain didn't invent RAG, but it made building RAG systems much easier.

Step 10: Build Agents

Developers wanted AI that could decide what to do.

Instead of hardcoding:

if weather:
    call_weather()

if pdf:
    search_pdf()

He created agents that could reason about which tool to use.

User
  │
  ▼
Agent
  │
  ├── Search Tool
  ├── Calculator
  ├── Database
  └── Weather API
