Instead of writing custom code for each service, developers could use standard interfaces.

Step 12: Build a Company

What began as an open-source side project quickly attracted thousands of developers after ChatGPT launched in November 2022.

The project grew into the LangChain company, which later expanded the ecosystem with:

LangChain – core framework
LangGraph – stateful and multi-agent workflows
LangSmith – testing, debugging, evaluation, and monitoring

